\'s potential diagonal extension, it is a passive move compared to the attacking power of an Open 3.\n\n**Reason:**\nThe move at **I7** is the strongest choice because it forms an **Open 3** using the existing stones at G9 and H8. This is a forcing move (Sente) that dictates the game flow, compelling Black to defend rather than develop their own attack. It seizes the initiative and builds a winning shape.\n\nAnswer: {"col": "I", "row": 7}'}
